k link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Created VersionHelper.php <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1731\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1731</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Removed sitemap ping because is deprecated <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1738\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1738</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Drop Ocelot announcer support 🫡 <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1727\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1727</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Use DEFAULT_CHARSET constant instead of hardcoded string <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1734\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1734</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Replaced some string functions to mbstring alternatives <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1735\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1735</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Replaced some html_entity_decode to engine&#039;s 